{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lazy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LazySequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:STsE4lazys12LazySequenceVyxGvp::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Cliques07MaximalA0V","extendedModule":"Swift","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Cliques","relatedModules":["Swift"]}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"lazy","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LazySequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","title":"lazy"},"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sequence.lazy","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques","abstract":[],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Cliques","type":"topic"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques/lazy":{"abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"lazy"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s12LazySequenceV","text":"LazySequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques\/lazy","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques\/lazy","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"lazy"},"doc://Cliques/documentation/Cliques/MaximalCliques":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/MaximalCliques","url":"\/documentation\/cliques\/maximalcliques","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every maximal clique of an undirected graph’s simple graph once, lazily, each in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order (by vertex index): an isolated vertex, or one whose only edges are loops, is a clique of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. The order is Eppstein–Löffler–Strash’s: by the cliques’ first vertex in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", then as Bron–Kerbosch with Tomita’s pivot (ties to the least"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"index) and branches in ascending index meets them. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again gives the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"degeneracy d."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"MaximalCliques","type":"topic"}}}